Your job is to solve problem for automotive clients, from OEM, supplier to value chain players. You will need to identify client's problem, analyzing and synthesizing relevant information and provide solution to our client.
In this role, you will need to lead one or more project modules or even small projects. You will guide module members – clients and colleagues alike. You will deal directly with clients and be responsible for mid-management level client communication
​​​​We are looking for talents with following skills and experience:
- Strong automotive industry know-how or auto consulting working experience, experience in commercial vehicle and supplier are preferred
- 6+ years working experienced in PV or CV OEM/supplier/value chain company or 4+ years consulting firm background serving such clients
- Passion for a challenging and rewarding consulting career;
- Solid analytics and communications capabilities;
- Intellectual curiosity and creativity;
- Leadership potential and team coaching skill
- Team player;
- Excellent Chinese and English language abilities
Do you have an entrepreneurial mindset and a winning personality? If this sounds like you, we would like to welcome you on board. We are looking forward to receiving your online application.

